# --- BINARIES AND COMPILATION (Culprits of 1500s and type errors) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/out/

# --- IDE AND LOCAL CONFIGURATIONS ---
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
**/.toolstarget

# --- FRONTEND AND HEAVY DEPENDENCIES ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/

# --- SECRETS AND LOCAL CONFIG (never ship in images) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*secret*.yaml
**/stage-dev-secrets.yaml
**/user-secrets.json

# --- VERSION CONTROL AND DOCKER ---
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.classpath

# --- DOCUMENTS AND LOGS ---
**/*.md
**/logs/
*.log

# --- EXCEPTIONS (Make sure these are NOT in the list above) ---
# Do not put docker-compose.yml or docker-compose.override.yml here